{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek the Last Hope Amidst Divine Ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Divinities is a Metroidvania-style, side\u2011scrolling Action\u2011adventure set in the aftermath of Ragnarok. Play as an adventurer who awakens in the devastated remnants of a world corrupted by divine energy, and delve into the secrets hidden beneath the crumbling Temple Ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/642ab428d6914219d7224a00f0a85e57.webp?t=1761909745\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/700a642da874ee6b0c40c81ae3f1b859.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/700a642da874ee6b0c40c81ae3f1b859.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/700a642da874ee6b0c40c81ae3f1b859.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When calamity struck, the Four Great Calamities tore the world asunder:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyss swallowed all light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duskreach froze the flow of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blightmire turned flesh into nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inferno rained burning skyfire upon the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in Rebel's Hold, your fate unknown, the truth buried deep. Traverse the fractured wasteland and piece together the lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/a3766e7b338a8bf280f500556fc20fa0.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/a3766e7b338a8bf280f500556fc20fa0.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/a3766e7b338a8bf280f500556fc20fa0.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/e131d7d454209d3deabdd67775eac0ac.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/e131d7d454209d3deabdd67775eac0ac.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/e131d7d454209d3deabdd67775eac0ac.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse is a vast, interconnected map of over a dozen uniquely themed regions and hundreds of labyrinthine passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these once\u2011holy domains, now reside over thirty formidable bosses shaped by disaster, as well as nearly a hundred twisted creations\u2014spirit-attuned artifacts and Slime Gels among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your mortal blade against these god\u2011forsaken battlefields\u2014the trail blazed by the Ferryman, the codes cracked by the Researcher, and Gatekeeper\u2019s unfinished vow. All will find new meaning under your sword!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/12a65274ada3583e962d5b300cf1147e.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/12a65274ada3583e962d5b300cf1147e.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/12a65274ada3583e962d5b300cf1147e.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/4c2bb446964ad61f06b4485ff4d101d2.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/4c2bb446964ad61f06b4485ff4d101d2.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/4c2bb446964ad61f06b4485ff4d101d2.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the apocalypse are ancient Divinity Fragments teeming with world\u2011upending might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness this broken power to forge your own combat style, building exclusive combos that reflect your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you gamble everything for a life\u2011for\u2011a\u2011hit devastation, dance along the blade\u2019s edge with surgical strikes, or unleash a relentless storm of attacks to crush any who dare approach, the choice\u2014and the power\u2014is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/466f58d73a32901889d7b9ccf05dc4eb.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/466f58d73a32901889d7b9ccf05dc4eb.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/466f58d73a32901889d7b9ccf05dc4eb.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/6fcce2931f84c14d5ee6d93cd5710478.poster.avif?t=1761909745\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/6fcce2931f84c14d5ee6d93cd5710478.webm?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418990/extras/6fcce2931f84c14d5ee6d93cd5710478.mp4?t=1761909745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal vessels seizing divine right. Collect the divine sigil left by the gods to weaponize their power! There are five core sigils:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phasewarp: </strong>Swiftly shifting in the blink of an eye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skystep:</strong> Riding the wind, moving through this broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulwark:</strong> Blocking and countering, protected by a holy shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assault: </strong>a gale of relentless strikes to suppress foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning: </strong>summon and command creatures to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore relentlessly to unlock ever\u2011